# Project context

Before any Feature or Infra task on this repository, read these root files:

- `DoD.md` — Definition of Done (tests, Swagger, ownership 403, no password leakage)
- `cahier-des-charges.md` — API contract, data model, transverse rules
- `tickets.md` — acceptance criteria per ticket

Respect:

- Resource ownership → **403** (not opaque 404) when acting on another user's list/card
- Never expose `password` in any API response
- JWT on login (`sub` + `exp`); routes under `/api`; Swagger UI at `/api`
- Align with `openapi.yaml` when adding or changing routes
